# Only new production setting in this release; optional and non-secret.
# Runtime display for chat messages/contacts and the teacher tutor conversation list.
# Missing, blank or invalid values fall back to Africa/Tripoli.
# Persisted timestamps, ISO values, exam boundaries and scheduler remain UTC.
# Rebuild Laravel config cache and refresh long-running processes after changing it.
# This setting itself does not require a Vite build.
# Preserve the existing APP_KEY, database, storage and provider settings.
# Do not replace the production .env with this file; no production action was executed.
# Operational commands and existing provider/queue requirements are authoritative in:
# DIGITALOCEAN_HANDOFF_AR.md (identical package-root and source/docs/deployment copies).
APP_DISPLAY_TIMEZONE=Africa/Tripoli
